7.DEPLOYMENT TOMACAT SERVER :

	Install Deploy to Container plugin :
	
		manage jenkins --> plugins --> available plugins ..> search Deploy to container plugin and install
	
	
	TOMCAT SERVER setup :
	
		wget https://dlcdn.apache.org/tomcat/tomcat-9/v9.0.122/bin/apache-tomcat-9.0.122.tar.gz
		tar -zxvf apache-tomcat-9.0.122.tar.gz 
		
		goto apache-tomcat-9.0.122/webapps/manager/META-INF vi context.xml (open context.xml and delete 21& 22 lines - :22 and 2dd)
		goto apache-tomcat-9.0.122/conf vi tomcat-users.xml (open file and setup roles manager-gui,manager-script and password)
		goto apache-tomcat-9.0.122/conf vi server.xml (open file goto 71 line and change port number 9090)
		
		goto apache-tomcat-9.0.122/bin perform sh shutdown.sh and sh startup.sh
		
	Add TOMCAT Credentials in Jenkins:
	
		Manage Jenkins --> Credentials --> add Credentials --> username with password
		
